# Engine generation tools

When editing `packages/engine/src/tools/`, read [AGENTS.md](../../packages/engine/src/tools/AGENTS.md).

## Library

Design-time / authoring helpers under `tools/` — **not** play `reduce`.

| Tool | Tag | Path |
|------|-----|------|
| Content pathing analyzer | `content-pathing-analyzer` | `tools/analyzer/` |
| Debug content sidecar | `debug-content` | `tools/debug-content/` |

Umbrella tag: `engine-tools`. Add new helpers as sibling folders and export from `tools/index.ts`.

## Rules

- Keep tools genre-neutral; no React/UI here.
- Block summary shortcuts require `{ type: 'tag', tagName: 'debug', exists: true }`.
- Hosts own file I/O for `debug-tags.json`; pass parsed JSON to `loadDebugTagSource` / `createDebugContentTool`.
